<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h2 style="color: #333;">Optional Holiday Request</h2>
  <p>Hello,</p>
  <p><strong>{{employeeName}}</strong> has requested an optional holiday:</p>
  <div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p><strong>Holiday:</strong> {{holidayName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{holidayDate}}</p>
    <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{requestUrl}}" style="background-color: #4a90e2; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;">Review Request</a>
  </div>
  <p>Please review and approve or reject this request.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br>Zuno HR System</p>
</div>

